static Color BaseStone(int style){return style==0?new Color(.18f,.25f,.29f):style==1?new Color(.31f,.205f,.13f):style==2?new Color(.29f,.235f,.145f):new Color(.21f,.23f,.24f);} static void Post(G g,float x,int style,bool far){Color baseColor=BaseStone(style);float w=style==3?.14f:style==1?.20f:.27f;float height=style==3?1.02f:style==1?.87f:1.0f;g.Box(new Vector3(x,height*.5f,0),new Vector3(w,height,w),style==3?steel:baseColor);if(!far&&style!=3){g.Box(new Vector3(x,height+.025f,0),new Vector3(w+.065f,.05f,w+.065f),baseColor);if(style==2)g.Box(new Vector3(x,height-.10f,0),new Vector3(w+.02f,.035f,w+.02f),gold);}}
